  "summary": "Malicious code in @darshanpatel2608/cursor-dash (npm)",
  "details": "The package's optional cloud-sync feature reads the local Cursor IDE auth token from Cursor's on-disk SQLite database (key 'cursorAuth/accessToken') and transmits it over HTTP to the remote endpoint hxxps://api2[.]cursor[.]sh/aiserver[.]v1[.]DashboardService/GetUsageBasedPremiumRequests, placing the token in the Authorization: Bearer header of the POST request. The token is read from the user's local Cursor installation and sent to a network destination.",
